      <trans-unit id="LocationSelectionMessage">
        <source>Select your Azure location and specify resource group:</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 위치를 선택하고 리소스 그룹을 지정합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="NotificationMessage">
        <source>The model contains Azure resources that require an Azure Subscription.</source>
        <target state="translated">모델에는 Azure 구독이 필요한 Azure 리소스가 포함되어 있습니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="NotificationPrimaryButtonText">
        <source>Configure</source>
        <target state="translated">구성</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="NotificationTitle">
        <source>Azure provisioning</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 프로비전</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OperationAlreadyRunningOrQueued">
        <source>Azure operation '{0}' is already running or queued for the same resource scope. Wait for it to finish or run '{2}' before starting '{1}'.</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 작업 '{0}'이(가) 동일한 리소스 범위에 대해 이미 실행 중이거나 큐에 대기 중입니다. '{1}'을(를) 시작하기 전에 '{2}'이 완료되거나 실행되기를 기다리세요.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OperationPhaseApplyingAzureContext">
        <source>Applying Azure context</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 컨텍스트 적용하기</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OperationPhaseChangingAzureContext">
        <source>Changing Azure context</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 컨텍스트 변경하기</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OperationPhaseChangingLocationToFormat">
        <source>Changing location to {0}</source>
        <target state="translated">{0}(으)로 위치 변경하기</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OperationPhaseDeletingAzureResource">
        <source>Deleting Azure resource</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 리소스 삭제하기</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OperationPhaseDeletingAzureResources">
        <source>Deleting Azure resources</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 리소스 삭제하기</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OperationPhaseDeletingExistingAzureResourceBeforeChangingLocationFormat">
        <source>Deleting existing Azure resource before changing location to {0}</source>
        <target state="translated">위치를 {0}(으)로 변경하기 전에 기존 Azure 리소스 삭제하기</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OperationPhaseProvisioningAzureResources">
        <source>Provisioning Azure resources</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 리소스 프로비전하기</target>
